{"slug":"david-scott-georgia-politician","qid":"Q132071","name":"David Scott","desc":"American politician (1945–2026)","article":"David Scott (Georgia politician)","born":"1945-06-27","died":"2026-04-22","birthplace":"Aynor","parties":["Democratic Party"],"offices":[{"t":"U.S. Representative","w":"GA-13","f":2003,"u":2026},{"t":"Georgia State Senate","w":"","f":1983,"u":2003},{"t":"Georgia House of Representatives","w":"","f":1975,"u":1983}],"summary":"David Albert Scott (June 27, 1945 – April 22, 2026) was an American politician and businessman who served as the U.S. representative for Georgia's 13th congressional district from 2003 until his death in 2026. Scott's district included all of Rockdale County, as well as portions of Clayton, DeKalb, Gwinnett, Henry, and Newton counties. Before his election to Congress in 2002, Scott served as a Democratic member of both chambers of the Georgia Legislature and operated a small business.","photo":null,"history":[{"y":2024,"o":"H","k":"GA-13","p":"D","v":256902,"s":71.83,"w":true,"n":"David Scott"},{"y":2022,"o":"H","k":"GA-13","p":"D","v":216388,"s":81.77,"w":true,"n":"David Scott"},{"y":2020,"o":"H","k":"GA-13","p":"D","v":279045,"s":77.39,"w":true,"n":"David Scott"},{"y":2018,"o":"H","k":"GA-13","p":"D","v":223157,"s":76.16,"w":true,"n":"David Scott"},{"y":2016,"o":"H","k":"GA-13","p":"D","v":252833,"s":100.0,"w":true,"n":"David Scott"},{"y":2014,"o":"H","k":"GA-13","p":"D","v":159445,"s":100.0,"w":true,"n":"David Scott"},{"y":2012,"o":"H","k":"GA-13","p":"D","v":201988,"s":71.74,"w":true,"n":"David Scott"},{"y":2010,"o":"H","k":"GA-13","p":"D","v":140294,"s":69.43,"w":true,"n":"David Scott"},{"y":2008,"o":"H","k":"GA-13","p":"D","v":205919,"s":69.04,"w":true,"n":"David Scott"},{"y":2006,"o":"H","k":"GA-13","p":"D","v":103019,"s":69.24,"w":true,"n":"David Scott"},{"y":2004,"o":"H","k":"GA-13","p":"D","v":170657,"s":100.0,"w":true,"n":"David Scott"},{"y":2002,"o":"H","k":"GA-13","p":"D","v":70011,"s":59.63,"w":true,"n":